SUMMARY:Wild Frames
DESCRIPTION:This panel discussion brings together two wildlife filmmakers to look at how stories of the wild reach the screen\, from choosing a landscape and finding compelling protagonists to filming their lives and shaping them into a narrative. What does it take to give a voice to the wild? \nThe panellists will draw on first-hand experience\, including the challenges of fieldwork\, and consider what it takes to build a career in this field. Requiring patience\, perseverance\, and a deep understanding of the natural world\, wildlife filmmaking is both science and art. \nIn collaboration with:\n       \n\n\nVenue : Auditorium\n\n\nBehind the Scenes of Wildlife Filmmaking\nRSVP here (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeM9xmyx25Z_5dihNgoYGwqVeOoFv4wci9WtymSuenJaWE1aw/viewform?usp=publish-editor)\n*Speakers*: Munmun Dhalaria\, Sugandhi Gadadhar\, Preeti Zachariah\n*Event Categories*: Film\, Wildlife
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/wild-frames/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Film,Wildlife
